5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried we spend more time finding people than picking companies. Who can actually be hired right now?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I’ve seen too many success stories that don’t match the bank statements. We need to verify the real returns.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Before we write another check, I need to know if we can actually afford the follow-on calls.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,My quarter-end is a nightmare. I need to know if this new company will make our reporting even worse.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I’ve noticed our last two deals stalled for months. I want to know why the money never reached the customer.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, if the numbers are fake, the talent pool is definitely fake too. We need to check the recruiters.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,Agreed. I’ll look at the exits and the write-offs to see what actually stuck.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I’m focusing on the credit line terms. If we can’t borrow, we can’t invest.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’m going to check the audit appraisals. I need to know if we can trust the numbers we report.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I’ll look into the security review times. If the tech is too complex, it will delay everything again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@May, if the credit line is tight, we can’t afford to hire expensive consultants to fix the mess.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,"I’m also looking at account retention. If they raise prices and lose customers, the story is over.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the reserve accounts. I need to see how much cash is actually sitting there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m also checking independent checks on the holdings. I need to see if anyone else has verified their claims.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll also look at the delivery records. I need to see if they actually shipped what they promised.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m going to look into the retained recruiters’ placement times. I need to know if we can actually fill the seats.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,George,,I’m also looking at the profile of the exits. I need to see which ones actually made money.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I’m also looking at the terms of last winter's credit line. I need to know our borrowing power.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’m also looking at the appraisal needs at the last audit. I need to know what the auditors are asking for.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’m also looking at the security review time before first deployment. I need to know how long the tech takes to go live.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
